8, \\\\ {lim}_{x\\to \\,{2}^{+}}f(x) & ={lim}_{x\\to \\,{2}^{+}}{x}^{2}=4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe conclude that statement II is false and\n\n$$\n{lim}_{x\\to {2}^{+}}f(x)\\ne {lim}_{x\\to {2}^{-}}f(x).\\,\\,\\times \n$$\n\nSince the second condition failed, $x=2$ is not a removable discontinuity. So, statement III is false.\n\nIn conclusion, only statement I is true." 13194139535798 true] [17592186366741 1000 #edb/ref 17592186366742 13194139535798 true] [17592186366741 1000 #edb/ref 17592186366743 13194139535798 true] [17592186366741 1000 #edb/ref 17592186366744 13194139535798 true] [17592186366741 1000 #edb/ref 17592186366745 13194139535798 true] [17592186366741 1000 #edb/ref 17592186366746 13194139535798 true] [17592186366741 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535798 true] [17592186366741 1041 "selection" 13194139535798 true] [17592186366741 1104 #edb/ref 17592186366743 13194139535798 true] [17592186366741 1110 #uuid "b6fa1780-41fc-5ac9-a457-609624ed0793" 13194139535798 true] [17592186366742 1034 "I and III only" 13194139535798 true] [17592186366742 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535798 true] [17592186366742 1111 #uuid "f869f8d5-2d75-57ad-b701-cef991d0f24c" 13194139535798 true] [17592186366743 1034 "I only" 13194139535798 true] [17592186366743 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535798 true] [17592186366743 1111 #uuid "8ad9a713-8c6f-5319-938c-da71e8be6643" 13194139535798 true] [17592186366744 1034 "III only" 13194139535798 true] [17592186366744 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535798 true] [17592186366744 1111 #uuid "ee5ddd70-dd75-5119-bd50-a2cb1fb29ba1" 13194139535798 true] [17592186366745 1034 "I and II only" 13194139535798 true] [17592186366745 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535798 true] [17592186366745 1111 #uuid "aa3b46a7-b87d-58e8-8e36-5632e2207d32" 13194139535798 true] [17592186366746 1034 "II only" 13194139535798 true] [17592186366746 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535798 true] [17592186366746 1111 #uuid "183e309e-2fa3-581b-af9b-43